{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\"sec\":\"S01\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S02\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S03\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S04\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S05\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"把“受过的气不该忍”解释成“用过去的委屈说服自己离开是对的”。完整稿表达的是不服气、认为不该忍受委屈，并没有直接认定离开必然正确；也把不敢多想快乐往事进一步解释成刻意用委屈抵消美好回忆。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S06\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S07\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S08\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S09\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S10\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S11\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S12\",\"score\":3,\"wrong\":\"把“不逼自己选边”拼成“不再强迫自己忘记过去”。两者意思不同：完整稿强调不必在怀念过去与承认受过委屈之间二选一，而不是是否强迫自己忘记过去。\"},\n    {\"sec\":\"S13\",\"score\":4,\"wrong\":\"无\"}\n  ],\n  \"story\":4,\n  \"story_note\":\"全曲故事与完整稿是同一件事，准确抓住了离开后的孤独、对亲近关系的怀念、回去与否的挣扎，以及最终承认过去的快乐和委屈都真实存在、带着想念继续生活的转变；S05和S12虽有局部理解偏差，但没有改变全曲故事主线。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "41d9913b-4b08-44f7-95ae-79b9e29b4f06", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T151720932178Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T15:18:16.840810+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "df479f561070bc2174a5b0815728698f259bbeab477c9bfe21ffc5b413cece78", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth"